{"id":"adb12f159542bc6f","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-df-zfc-model10-expansion-by-predicate.md","title":"ZFC Model10 Expansion By Predicate","display":"df-zfc-model10-expansion-by-predicate — ZFC Model10 Expansion By Predicate","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-model10-expansion-by-predicate","aliases":["58-df-zfc-model10-expansion-by-predicate"],"display":"df-zfc-model10-expansion-by-predicate — ZFC Model10 Expansion By Predicate","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch01/58-df-zfc-model5-expansion.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-model10-expansion-by-predicate"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-model10-expansion-by-predicate</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-model10-expansion-by-predicate — ZFC Model10 Expansion By Predicate"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36e399406195f579\" href=\"?note=36e399406195f579\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-zfc-model5-expansion.md\">../batch01/58-df-zfc-model5-expansion.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal N,\\mathcal M,P,A,L_0,L_1\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal N,\\mathcal M,P,A,L_0,L_1\\in V\\)</span>, where <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> is a fresh unary relation symbol</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_i.\\mathrm{Cst},L_i.\\mathrm{Fun}_n,L_i.\\mathrm{Rel}_n\">\\(L_i.\\mathrm{Cst},L_i.\\mathrm{Fun}_n,L_i.\\mathrm{Rel}_n\\)</span> are the signature components</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Univ}\">\\(\\mathrm{Univ}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I^{\\mathcal N}_{\\mathrm{rel},1}\">\\(I^{\\mathcal N}_{\\mathrm{rel},1}\\)</span> are the universe and unary-relation interpretation components</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel5Expansion}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel5Expansion}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36e399406195f579\" href=\"?note=36e399406195f579\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-zfc-model5-expansion.md\">../batch01/58-df-zfc-model5-expansion.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel10ExpansionByPredicate}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel10ExpansionByPredicate}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model10\\text{-}expansion\\text{-}by\\text{-}predicate} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel10ExpansionByPredicate}_S(\\mathcal N,\\mathcal M,P,A)\\leftrightarrow \\exists L_0,L_1\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcModel5Expansion}_S(L_0,L_1,\\mathcal N,\\mathcal M)\\land P\\notin L_0.\\mathrm{Rel}_1\\land L_1.\\mathrm{Cst}=L_0.\\mathrm{Cst}\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(L_1.\\mathrm{Fun}_n=L_0.\\mathrm{Fun}_n)\\land L_1.\\mathrm{Rel}_1=L_0.\\mathrm{Rel}_1\\cup\\{P\\}\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(n\\neq1\\to L_1.\\mathrm{Rel}_n=L_0.\\mathrm{Rel}_n)\\land A\\subseteq\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\\land I^{\\mathcal N}_{\\mathrm{rel},1}(P)=A\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model10\\text{-}expansion\\text{-}by\\text{-}predicate} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel10ExpansionByPredicate}_S(\\mathcal N,\\mathcal M,P,A)\\leftrightarrow \\exists L_0,L_1\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcModel5Expansion}_S(L_0,L_1,\\mathcal N,\\mathcal M)\\land P\\notin L_0.\\mathrm{Rel}_1\\land L_1.\\mathrm{Cst}=L_0.\\mathrm{Cst}\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(L_1.\\mathrm{Fun}_n=L_0.\\mathrm{Fun}_n)\\land L_1.\\mathrm{Rel}_1=L_0.\\mathrm{Rel}_1\\cup\\{P\\}\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(n\\neq1\\to L_1.\\mathrm{Rel}_n=L_0.\\mathrm{Rel}_n)\\land A\\subseteq\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\\land I^{\\mathcal N}_{\\mathrm{rel},1}(P)=A\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is an expansion by exactly one fresh unary predicate; the general expansion predicate guarantees that the universe and all old interpretations are preserved.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-zfc-model5-expansion.md","status":"resolved","id":"36e399406195f579","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-zfc-model5-expansion.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-zfc-model5-expansion.md","status":"resolved","id":"36e399406195f579","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcModel5Expansion}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch01/58-df-zfc-model5-expansion.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal N,\\mathcal M,P,A,L_0,L_1\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"L_i.\\mathrm{Cst},L_i.\\mathrm{Fun}_n,L_i.\\mathrm{Rel}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Univ}","display":false},{"tex":"I^{\\mathcal N}_{\\mathrm{rel},1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcModel5Expansion}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\